The component catalogue under src/FluidScript.Core/Sizing and its data files contain factual
dimension data (pipe diameters, valve Kv values) gathered from public manufacturer sources. Facts are
not copyrightable and no standard's table text is reproduced anywhere in this repository; each
catalogue row carries two public sources, listed with publisher, URL and retrieval date in
SOURCES.md.

SharpProp and CoolProp carry their own licences, listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.
